  - formal verification
abstract: >-
  The Lean 4 and Mathlib proofs of sphere packing optimality in dimensions 8 and 24, with
  uniqueness of the Leech packing among periodic packings (math-inc/Sphere-Packing-Lean at
  1e98fb4), copied unchanged, with an independent check added by Deep Bhattacharjee: a static
  scan, a statement audit, a CI build with the axioms and a kernel replay, and Python, Julia, C
  and C++ checks of the E8 and Leech lattices. The state of the Kepler conjecture in proof
  assistants is recorded in kepler/STATUS.md.
